casebook c-46cfr-63_15-7-and-63_25-1-boiler-draft v1
source "C-46cfr-63.15-7-and-63.25-1-boiler.txt" dated 2026-10-14 by "drafted by anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 from the manual; not yet approved"
note "UNAPPROVED DRAFT: written by a language model from C-46cfr-63.15-7-and-63.25-1-boiler.txt. Every declaration below cites the sentence"
note "it came from. Check each against the manual, add what the manual does not say, then delete"
note "this note to approve. quorum studio will not build a chip image while it is here."

# manual: "when a flame safety system shutdown occurs"
observe flame_safety_shutdown_occurred "a flame safety system shutdown has occurred"

# manual: "operation of the lower low water cutoff"
observe low_water_cutoff_operated "the lower low water cutoff has operated"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe start_requested "a boiler start or ignition has been requested"

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
observe prepurge_done "the prepurge period has been completed"

# manual: "when the low water cutoff has activated"
observe small_boiler_lwco_activated "the low water cutoff of a small automatic auxiliary boiler has activated"

# manual: "the opening of the fuel oil valve"
observe fuel_valve_opening "the fuel oil valve is opening or open"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe ignition_on "ignition has occurred"

# manual: "An audible alarm must automatically sound when a flame safety system shutdown occurs."
claim flame_safety_trip "flame safety system shutdown requiring an audible alarm and visible indicator" severity 7 needs flame_safety_shutdown_occurred

# manual: "For steam boilers, operation of the lower low water cutoff must automatically sound an audible alarm."
claim low_water_trip "lower low water cutoff operation requiring an audible alarm and visual indicator" severity 7 needs low_water_cutoff_operated

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
claim small_boiler_lwco_indication "low water cutoff activation on a small boiler must be indicated visually" severity 4 needs small_boiler_lwco_activated

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
claim fuel_before_ignition "fuel oil valve opened without ignition before or at the same time" severity 5 needs fuel_valve_opening

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
claim start_too_soon "starting now would skip the required prepurge" severity 5 needs start_requested

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
prepurge_done rebuts start_too_soon

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
ignition_on rebuts fuel_before_ignition

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers defined as having heat-input ratings of 400,000 Btu/hr. or less (117 kilowatts or less) must also meet the following requirements."
action keep_running idle

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
action indicate_lwco_activation when any small_boiler_lwco_indication

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
action hold_start when any start_too_soon fuel_before_ignition

# manual: "An audible alarm must automatically sound when a flame safety system shutdown occurs."
action raise_alarm when any low_water_trip flame_safety_trip

# manual: "when a flame safety system shutdown occurs"
action shut_down_boiler safe when any flame_safety_trip low_water_trip

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
prefer shut_down_boiler over raise_alarm over indicate_lwco_activation over hold_start over keep_running
